1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Two-thirty-seconds is legal.

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Legal isn't the same as safe.

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
Below three-thirty-seconds, rain grip drops
fast — hydroplaning risk climbs sharply.

4
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Below four-thirty-seconds,
snow grip goes next.

5
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Two different numbers.
Two different seasons.

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
One check tells you both.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before the
next storm, not after.
